<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JULY 21/22.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JULY 21/22.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania on Monday</p>
<p>set the following currency fixings for July 22. The litas is</p>
<p>pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   21.07.97	  18.07.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.7122	    6.6860</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.2330	    2.2306</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.4050	    4.4030</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.4587	    3.4578</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5148	    0.5135</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7556	    0.7546</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2791	    0.2789</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.9499	    6.9469</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6911	    0.6910</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.1451	    1.1315</p>
<p>-- Burton Frierson, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
